  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_a23640f79ab54ebfb5843cb73c1ac9ad",
      "statement": "CaClient in utils/cautils/client.go is the single interface commands use for CA operations: X.509 Sign/Renew/RenewWithToken/Revoke/Rekey/Version/GetRootCAs/GetCaURL plus SSH Sign/Renew/Rekey/Revoke/Roots/Federation/Config/CheckHost/GetHosts/Bastion; the online implementation is the *ca.Client from smallstep/certificates and the offline implementation is *cautils.OfflineCA.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://utils/cautils/client.go#L29-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a000d1d60c28618e22b0902c70b819e3b30b8ab48eaededb488012c2aad4d575:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bb78ea150d774d34855d59f34cf60b0d",
      "statement": "NewClient selects the CA mode from flags: --offline requires --ca-config and returns NewOfflineCA(ctx, caConfig); otherwise it resolves the CA URL via flags.ParseCaURL, defaults the root to pki.GetRootCAPath() (required-flag error when missing), prepends ca.WithRootFile, and returns ca.NewClient(caURL, opts...).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://utils/cautils/client.go#L52-L74",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:728e02c9fda0397f940ca7b0af3633c0e94b12b6a90ea0c7f7b0dbc4d00b5619:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4b345683cee74d7e821f52e3feb2e47c",
      "statement": "NewUnauthenticatedAdminClient builds an unauthenticated *ca.AdminClient for the management API requiring --ca-url; NewAdminClient requires --admin-cert and --admin-key together when given, otherwise prints a 'No admin credentials found' notice, generates a default key, prompts for an admin name/subject unless --admin-subject is set, creates a SignType token via NewTokenFlow, signs a CSR with an online client, and constructs ca.NewAdminClient with ca.WithAdminX5C(adminCert, adminKey, password-file).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://utils/cautils/client.go#L77-L204",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bc13efbe70d273b1058a4947faca107ce22ceb5f4c6a521b3856466e001aa40d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9290978ce8854af094ca754461ff3ee7",
      "statement": "CertificateFlow holds an optional *OfflineCA and offline flag; NewCertificateFlow applies the given Options to the package-level sharedContext flowContext and, in offline mode, requires --ca-config and constructs the OfflineCA.",
