    {
      "id": "claim_14ffa45a58bc46b1b47d4b498b6576cf",
      "statement": "OfflineCA accessors: GetCaURL returns https://<first DNSName>, GetRootCAs always returns nil, CaURL/Root/Provisioners read the config, and Audience maps token types to https://<host>/<endpoint> audiences (/sign, /renew, /revoke, /ssh/sign, /ssh/renew, /ssh/revoke, /ssh/rekey).",
