      "statement": "OfflineCA.Sign authorizes the OTT with authority.Authorize under a provisioner.SignMethod context and signs with SignWithContext passing NotBefore/NotAfter/TemplateData; Renew extracts the leaf of the TLS client certificate from the passed http.Transport and renews it, while RenewWithToken authorizes a one-time token first; all return the chain (leaf plus intermediate) and the authority TLS options.",
