      "statement": "OfflineCA also wraps Revoke, Rekey, SSHSign, SSHRevoke, SSHRenew, SSHRekey, SSHRoots and SSHFederation against the corresponding authority.Authority methods, and Version reports the authority version, so the embedded CA satisfies the full CaClient interface.",
